/// Review finding (verification-gap layer) — mirrors `_pumpScreen` above,
/// but with the exact `locale`/`localizationsDelegates`/`supportedLocales`
/// trio `main.dart`'s `CerneApp` pins to `pt_BR`, so a test can actually
